# GitHub asks these people for a review when a PR changes a matching file.
# The last matching line wins. Ownership table: README.md, "Who owns what".
#
# The first line makes every PR need the owner's approval. The lines below it
# are the shared files, kept listed so they stay visible. To let a teammate
# co-approve their own area, add a line such as:
#   /player/   @waritctd @their-github-name
# (they must have write access to the repo, or GitHub ignores the line)

*                     @waritctd

/project.godot        @waritctd
/autoload/events.gd   @waritctd
/docs/                @waritctd
/tools/               @waritctd
/.github/             @waritctd
/.gitignore           @waritctd
/.gitattributes       @waritctd
